        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset CA, Ball Shaped Circa Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Circa knob is distinctive in its beauty and grace. The ball shape lends the perfect finishing touch to any door in any decor be it traditional, modern, or any style in between. The Kwikset CA Circa Knobset fits most pre-drilled doors. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" for door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\". Available in half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Circa Ball Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey Anti-pick system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Circa Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-31.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door.  Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on the middle of the interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is located in the middle of the exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Circa Door Knob Set, Kwikset CA",
                "description": "Kwikset CA Signature Series Circa Knob - The Circa knob is distinctive in its beauty and grace. The ball shape lends the perfect finishing touch to any door in any decor be it traditional, modern, or any style in between. The Kwikset CA Circa Knobset fits most pre-drilled doors. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. Available in half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.",
